    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A casual, quirky platformer about a dog on a very personal mission.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a dog. You have a goal. It\u2019s not saving the world \u2014 it\u2019s finding your <i>favorite poo spot</i>.<br>Leap, dodge, and bark your way through a series of chaotic and funny challenges to reach the sacred destination where you can finally do your business in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>light-hearted platformer</strong> with simple controls, strange enemies, and a surprising amount of determination.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc36 <strong>Play as a determined dog</strong> on a mission to reach the ultimate poo spot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Classic 2D platformer gameplay</strong> \u2013 Run, jump, and dodge your way through tricky stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3c <strong>Weird and wacky enemies</strong> \u2013 Avoid:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese-shooting cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pushy birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >soju bottles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slippery ice blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >moving platforms and more!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf57 <strong>Power-up items</strong> to help on your journey:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chicken Wings</strong> \u2013 Gain the ability to multi-jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water</strong> \u2013 Launch into a powerful super jump</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca9 <strong>Reach your final goal</strong> \u2014 your favorite place to poop \u2014 and bask in your hard-earned glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing for the laughs or the platforming, this silly little journey will leave a lasting impression.</p>",
